{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s6ea15c593518dfca","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-897ac97e40058a667e77","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s6ea15c593518dfca","text":"푸하——드디어 숨을 쉴 수 있겠어, 징. 저 돌 조각상들과 인내력을 겨루기 위해 한참 동안 움직이지 않았거든……","speaker":"조각상 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"조각상 벌레","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["7900471669658361212"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3184748121206589083"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-09b6fe332ff899d28a04","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s6ea15c593518dfca","text":"네가 이 방에 들어오자마자 저 녀석들이 움직일 줄은 몰랐어…. 싱겁게 이겼네, 징","speaker":"조각상 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"조각상 벌레","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["13522157868621251829"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3184748121206589083"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-04adf46c803e8adf97c7","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s6ea15c593518dfca","text":"챔피언 지분의 삼 분의 일은 내 몫이군","speaker":"","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"조각상 벌레","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["11775078716193488465"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-215a5c44c0e1bf712a97","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s6ea15c593518dfca","text":"징! 그 말도 틀린 건 아니네, 징……","speaker":"조각상 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"조각상 벌레","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["16124718638038285185"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3184748121206589083"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-efe406c9fb843ffeebbb","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s6ea15c593518dfca","text":"하지만 넌 원래 움직일 수 없잖아","speaker":"","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"조각상 벌레","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["2061615689569767509"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-acaabb24a43d4aafcb81","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s6ea15c593518dfca","text":"징징! 그렇게 말하면 안 되지! 네가 보지 못하는 곳에서는 얼마나 신나게 움직이는데!","speaker":"조각상 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"조각상 벌레","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["14198026879905818631"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3184748121206589083"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-6548003b981e2f8f0174","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s6ea15c593518dfca","text":"어쨌든 네 덕분에 이번 시합은 내가 이겼어, 징!","speaker":"조각상 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"조각상 벌레","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["7061897102977090197"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3184748121206589083"],"speakerUnresolved":false}],"wikiReading":{"schema":"hsr-wiki-reading.v1","missions":[{"id":"interaction-p15862","title":"상호작용 기록","page":"虫鸣秘闻•3.0","officialMissionIds":[]}],"occurrences":[{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-897ac97e40058a667e77","rowId":"other-interaction-p15862-897ac97e40058a667e77","missionId":"interaction-p15862","mission":"상호작용 기록","sceneId":"s6ea15c593518dfca","scene":"조각상 벌레","contextId":"wiki-context-a16dbfb9fd22789bb4ea2666","page":"虫鸣秘闻•3.0","revision":72039,"location":[1,0],"conditions":[],"branch":[],"nextIds":["other-interaction-p15862-09b6fe332ff899d28a04"],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-09b6fe332ff899d28a04","rowId":"other-interaction-p15862-09b6fe332ff899d28a04","missionId":"interaction-p15862","mission":"상호작용 기록","sceneId":"s6ea15c593518dfca","scene":"조각상 벌레","contextId":"wiki-context-a16dbfb9fd22789bb4ea2666","page":"虫鸣秘闻•3.0","revision":72039,"location":[1,1],"conditions":[],"branch":[],"nextIds":["other-interaction-p15862-04adf46c803e8adf97c7","other-interaction-p15862-efe406c9fb843ffeebbb"],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-04adf46c803e8adf97c7","rowId":"other-interaction-p15862-04adf46c803e8adf97c7","missionId":"interaction-p15862","mission":"상호작용 기록","sceneId":"s6ea15c593518dfca","scene":"조각상 벌레","contextId":"wiki-context-a16dbfb9fd22789bb4ea2666"